🔎 10. GET Method

GET = Server se resource retrieve/request karna.

Example:

GET https://tryhackme.com/index.php

Meaning:

Server se index.php resource maango.

Browser mein URL type karne par browser background mein HTTP request create karta hai.

Flow:

Browser → GET Request → Web Server → Response → Browser

🛠️ 11. Browser Developer Tools

GET request ko practically dekhne ke liye:

Firefox → F12 → Network tab → Reload

Network tab mein browser ki requests दिखाई देंगी.

Request select karne par important fields mil sakti hain:

Scheme

Kaunsa protocol use hua?

HTTP / HTTPS

Host

Kis host/server ko request bheji?

Filename

Kaunsa resource/file request kiya?

Example:

/

usually homepage ko represent karta hai.

Address

Server ka IP address.

Example:

127.0.0.1

ka matlab local machine.

Status

Request ka result.

Example:

200 OK = Request successful ✅

📦 12. HTTP Response

Server ka response mainly 2 important parts mein dekha ja sakta hai:

Response Header

Response ke baare mein metadata/information.

Response Body

Actual requested content/data.

Example:

Website ka HTML → Response Body

